<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">教师工作区</text><text class="title">方案进度与困难跟进</text><text class="muted">自报完成、受阻和正式答卷封存分别查看，不自动表示掌握或教学有效。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><text class="heading">原跟进待确认</text><text>本机只保留操作标识。先查原回执，不新建重复跟进；离开后不能重建原私有文字。</text><text wx:if="{{pending.invalid}}" class="notice">本机追踪格式已不可用。先从下方网页入口核对已保存历史，再明确关闭本机追踪，不会撤销服务器记录。</text><button bindtap="recover" disabled="{{busy || pending.invalid}}">查询原操作回执</button><button wx:if="{{canRetry}}" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">明确重试本页原请求</button><button bindtap="abandon" disabled="{{busy}}">关闭本机追踪并重读</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{header}}">
    <view class="card"><text class="heading">{{header.student}} · {{header.subject}}</text><text>{{header.className}} · 第 {{header.version}} 版 · {{header.execution}}</text><text class="strong">{{header.title}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{header.goal}}</text><text>自报完成 {{header.complete}} · 受阻/困难 {{header.blocked}} · 正式答卷封存 {{header.sealed}}</text><text wx:if="{{!header.current}}" class="notice">当前查看历史/撤回版本，只读；不会自动切入新的发布版。</text></view>
    <picker range="{{versions}}" range-key="label" value="{{versionIndex}}" bindchange="version" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"><view class="field">{{versions[versionIndex].label}}</view></picker>
    <picker wx:if="{{choices.length}}" range="{{choices}}" range-key="title" value="{{selectedIndex}}" bindchange="choose" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"><view class="field">{{choices[selectedIndex].title}}</view></picker>
    <view wx:if="{{activity}}" class="card"><text class="heading">{{activity.order}}. {{activity.title}}</text><text>{{activity.kind}} · {{activity.stateLabel}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{activity.instructions}}</text><text wx:if="{{!activity.materialsAvailable}}" class="notice">材料当前受阻，需单独核对授权；不能把它当作学生未学习。</text>
      <block wx:if="{{activity.formal}}"><text wx:if="{{activity.formal.requiresPermission}}">缺少批改权限，正式测评详情未知。</text><block wx:else><text>正式测评：{{activity.formal.title}}</text><text wx:if="{{activity.formal.stopped}}">已停止新执行；已开始答卷按原规则处理。</text><text>封存时间：{{activity.formal.sealed}}</text></block></block>
      <block wx:if="{{activity.current}}"><text class="strong">学生当前上交：{{activity.current.label}}</text><text>{{activity.current.at}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{activity.current.text}}</text><text wx:if="{{activity.current.difficulty}}">{{activity.current.difficulty}}</text></block>
      <view wx:if="{{activity.follow}}"><text class="strong">本人对当前困难的私有跟进 · {{activity.follow.at}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{activity.follow.note}}</text></view>
      <block wx:if="{{activity.canHandle}}"><text class="heading">新增私有处理记录</text><text class="muted">仅本人可见。学生只看到当前困难的处理时间，原困难仍保留；不替学生完成、不改成绩。未保存文字仅在本页内存，离开或隐藏会清除。</text><textarea class="feedback-text short-text" value="{{note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="change" maxlength="2000" placeholder="本人跟进措施、沟通与待核对情况" aria-label="仅本人可见的困难跟进备注" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" /><checkbox-group data-field="confirm" bindchange="change"><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{confirm}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" />已核对当前困难，仅记录处理，不代表完成或掌握</label></checkbox-group><button bindtap="save" type="primary" disabled="{{busy || pending || !confirm || !note}}">核对并保存私有跟进</button></block>
    </view>
    <button data-action="progress" bindtap="web" disabled="{{busy}}">复制网页当前进度/完整历史入口</button><button data-action="execution" bindtap="web" disabled="{{busy}}">复制网页正式调整/复盘入口</button><text class="footnote">网页需正常登录并重新核对当前版本和权限，复制链接不提交操作。</text>
  </block>
  <text wx:if="{{!header &amp;&amp; !busy &amp;&amp; !error}}" class="notice">当前进度已隐藏，请刷新并核对当前学校身份后读取。</text><button bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">刷新所选发布版本</button><button wx:if="{{error || !header}}" bindtap="login">返回登录核对身份</button>
</view>
